"Release an ended member's seat in a team created in this session (a team seats 24 members; ejected members do not count). member is an exact worker ID (ag_NN) or a role. The member must have ended: stop a working or idle one with agent_kill first. Its role stays reserved, its transcript and history stay, it stops receiving team messages and cannot be resumed. A team restored from this session's history (after a reload) can be ejected from too, though team_add still refuses it. Persisted, so it survives reload and restart."
